340	// Which lifecycle actions an invoice offers depends on where it is in its lifecycle: a draft can be
341	// sent, a sent invoice can be marked paid. Collecting the mapping here keeps the row markup flat and
342	// gives one obvious place to add a new lifecycle action.
343	function InvoiceActions({
